# The canonical guidance is in `.claude/`

This repo's AI guidance is maintained once, for Claude Code, and Cursor uses the same files:

- `CLAUDE.md`
- every file in `.claude/rules/` (start with `team-charter.md`; the others say which paths they apply to)
- the workflows in `.claude/skills/`
- the team memory in `notes/`

Do not add rules or skills under `.cursor/`. Edit `.claude/` instead (team charter §9).
